SY_TALK("fDJj0p5u1SY",[[3,["Today it's a great day for us, for all the","Sahaja Yogis that on this day, I would say"]],[20,["we are late by one day or two days, the Sahasrara","was opened out."]],[38,["It was just a miracle I should say because","I didn't think that I am at a point where"]],[56,["it could be done."]],[60,["So I wanted to wait but some things happened","that made Me think that it has to be open."]],[84,["It was","in such a situation that I felt if I delayed"]],[100,["any more now, it may help these false gurus","to spread their nonsense all over."]],[114,["This is just I should say, is a Sahaj way","of doing things."]],[129,["Now 25 years have passed."]],[133,["You all have gathered during this time, and","we have so many others who are not here, who"]],[141,["have achieved so many things."]],[146,["But perhaps, we are not aware as to what we","have achieved in the real sense of the word."]],[156,["You've got your vibrations."]],[160,["You can feel this All Pervading Power."]],[166,["You are as they say, swimming in the ocean","of joy."]],[172,["You are all enjoying the collectivity, and","that you have transcended many of your limitations."]],[185,["All this has happened to you because it is","your right to have it."]],[193,["I don't take any credit for it."]],[196,["Only thing all the time I've been pointing","it out to you one thing that now, you have"]],[209,["entered into the Kingdom of God, and enjoy","yourself."]],[216,["We have to see around ourselves."]],[220,["The whole nature enjoys itself; doesn't bother,","doesn't bother about anything."]],[227,["They haven't got realization."]],[230,["They haven't felt the Paramachaitanya."]],[234,["But how is it they know that we have to enjoy?"]],[240,["The flowers that come out for a short time","and fade out, but as long as they live,"]],[248,["they're very happy."]],[250,["They don't think of their past or of their","future, but they enjoy the present."]],[258,["And in the present, they enjoy what is - that","they are fragrant"]],[264,["and giving fragrance to others."]],[266,["They're beautiful and they are soothing others."]],[271,["The whole nature is like that."]],[273,["If you look at the birds or anything that","we call as natural is all sort of"]],[283,["in a meditative mood."]],[285,["All these hills, and big, big mountains."]],[292,["They look as if they are witness to whatever","has been happening."]],[300,["Now we have to really first look back what","we have achieved."]],[309,["That is important, because if you're climbing","up on a hill, if you look back,"]],[318,[" you get a shock and you may fall down."]],[322,["So normally people say, never look back."]],[325,["But a person who has earned some treasure,","he again and again goes and counts it and"]],[337,["finds out how much he has got, and every time","he sees that, he enjoys."]],[345,["So to know relatively what we have got and","how we have achieved something will definitely"]],[354,["give you greater strength of mind and richness","of life."]],[364,["The first thing that has happened to you I","would say it is very important is this - that"]],[372,["you have felt this All Pervading Power."]],[376,["That shows that you must have been great seekers","of truth, honest, sincere, sensible."]],[386,["That just coming to My program you felt the","vibrations, and after that you started settling"]],[400,["down into it."]],[402,["So many of you have felt it suddenly, and","they were amazed and they were shocked and"]],[410,["surprised, and they wanted to test whether","it is true or not."]],[416,["But then you were confident, you found it","that you've got definitely a new dimension"]],[425,["in your life, and that you are feeling this","All Pervading Power of Divine Love."]],[435,["I'll take one lecture sufficient to describe","this All Pervading Power."]],[442,["But what you got out of it is the essence","of it, one has to know, is a complete freedom."]],[453,["You have achieved your complete freedom."]],[455,["First of all, the freedom has come to you,","first of all, most important,"]],[463,["is from your ego."]],[467,["This wall of ego you have crossed."]],[471,["You have got out of the bondage of this ego,","which was really so much full of"]],[484,["problems for you."]],[486,["So many things this ego does of which you","are not aware."]],[492,["Firstly, a person who is egoist doesn't mind","hurting anyone."]],[500,["He hurts, but if he's hurt, he doesn't like","it."]],[505,["Immediately start crying."]],[506,["Specially I've seen people who have too much","ego are very easily hurt, but they don't understand"]],[514,["how many people they have hurt already, and","how many are really frightened of such a person."]],[528,["So you got rid of your ego."]],[531,["It is sinful to hurt any other human being","for anything; for whatever may be the reason"]],[539,["that you feel you should hurt another one."]],[543,["The first is the revenge; the idea of revenge","is there, that I must take a revenge on the"]],[550,["person who has hurt me or has done some wrong","to me or something of that kind."]],[561,["This idea of revenge comes when you react."]],[566,["Some react very violently."]],[568,["I have seen people murdering each other in","the name of revenge, killing their own kith"]],[577,["and kin, killing their fellow men, their country","men, all over the world is some sort of a"]],[584,["stupid idea of revenge."]],[590,["But if you go to the subtle side of revenge,","what is it?"]],[595,["What revenge have you taken?"]],[597,["Supposing there is somebody who has troubled","you."]],[600,["You are angry with that person and you have","killed that person, so you have actually"]],[605,["saved him."]],[607,["He won't have to suffer from guilty conscience,","it won't have to do anything, it's just finished."]],[614,["What is the revenge is?"]],[617,["The revenge should be only by which a person","gets out of his idea of killing others."]],[627,["Like a sword never fights a sword, it fights","the shield."]],[632,["In the same way, the revenge that we think","we can take on another person is not a revenge,"]],[645,["because any action you take in the name of","revenge comes back to you"]],[652,["and hurts you much more."]],[655,["So many things can happen if a person in the","name of revenge starts acting."]],[661,["Now for example, these days you know in the","whole world,"]],[664,[" there's so much of revenge going on,"]],[667,["even in the name of God; taking revenge","because certain people are following some"]],[676,["religion, or they are doing something else","that you are doing."]],[682,["Working out this kind of a revenge, what has","happening is that you are just killing people,"]],[689,["destroying them, who do not even understand","what sort of a revenge you are taking."]],[696,["People are putting bombs and putting all kinds","of things and by that thousands of innocent"]],[702,["people one is killing; so what kind of a revenge","have you taken?"]],[708,["They don't deserve any revenge."]],[711,["So this revenge when it explodes can destroy","so many innocent people and it will definitely"]],[719,["react on you."]],[721,["You cannot get away with it."]],[724,["It's a very long process of this revenge."]],[733,["I've told you about Bermuda Triangle what","they say, that so many blacks were taken slaves"]],[741,["and were drowned in that area, so their spirits","they are saying, are haunting on the people"]],[748,["who are passing by; mostly the whites and","they just drowned."]],[754,["So it's a very long process, and all that","I need not discuss at this auspicious occasion,"]],[761,["but I have to say that when we take a revenge,","every action has a reaction."]],[767,["So somehow you have got out of that idea of","revenge, just out of that idea."]],[776,["There's another thing that if you don't take","revenge, and leave it to God, It acts."]],[785,["It acts, not only that, but a Divine Power","takes into Its own control how to really give"]],[796,["a good lesson to that person or to that community","or to that kind of organization which is taking"]],[805,["a revenge on you."]],[809,["You don't have to worry."]],[813,["I'll have to tell you that in this 25 years","I've seen,"]],[817,[" people have been extremely unkind to me."]],[820,["Many organizations, many so called religions,","and all kinds of things have been after us."]],[827,["Media has been after us."]],[829,["Take the example of French media."]],[832,["They tried to trouble us so much and tried","to bring bad name to us, doesn't matter."]],[841,["The media people now, three of them who went","to India, are now under warrant and if they"]],[849,["go to India, they will be arrested."]],[853,["I didn't do anything."]],[855,["We didn't do anything."]],[858,["Secondly, the same media, I mean the same","newspapers are all bankrupt."]],[867,["You didn't do anything about it."]],[869,["You didn't go and say that they should become","bankrupt."]],[872,["You didn't take any revenge."]],[873,["Why should we?"]],[874,["Why should we take any revenge?"]],[876,["Because we are not bothered as to what happens;","we are not bothered as to what these people"]],[884,["have done to us."]],[886,["But legally they are now involved in such","a way that they are under warrant and if they"]],[894,["go to India, they'll be arrested."]],[897,["And the whole of French government is with","them, all of them are trying so much, but"]],[904,["this punishment is on their head."]],[908,["In their lifetime, they didn't have to die","or anything;"]],[912,[" in their lifetime they have got it."]],[915,["So you have got this special power that you","don't have to take revenge or you have to"]],[924,["just forgive."]],[925,["Just forgive and the forgiveness will look","after the whole arrangement of how to bring"]],[934,["the other person to its proper path."]],[940,["So once you are out of this idea of revenge,","you really feel very peaceful, extremely peaceful"]],[950,["because this peace that you have within yourself","is not unnatural, it's not mental, but its"]],[957,["just happens to you."]],[958,["It's all right."]],[959,["So what if they have said, they have done","anything wrong to us?"]],[964,["Why should we bother?"]],[965,["So many things are there which I can tell","you have worked out automatically."]],[973,["Now in Turkey they told Me that there is some","boy who is from England and he went and told"]],[982,["the media something against Sahaja Yoga and","it was all published."]],[987,["But in the court he confessed that, \"Whatever","I said was wrong.\""]],[993,["Nobody went and told him, nobody threatened","him, nothing happened."]],[997,["So from your point of view you must understand,","that you're not going to get into any mess"]],[1005,["of taking revenge of any kind, because you","belong to the Government of God."]],[1013,["And this Government is extremely alert, very","genuine and also extremely efficient."]],[1023,["And as far as you are concerned, you are a","citizen of that Great Kingdom."]],[1030,["So what you have achieved is the citizenship","of this great Kingdom of God where you should"]],[1037,["feel absolutely secured."]],[1040,["The man who is secure is never afraid, never","afraid."]],[1046,["So you have also got rid of your fear."]],[1051,["Man is in the - I don't know why he's afraid","of this and afraid of that, and worries about"]],[1058,["this and worries about that."]],[1062,["It's something surprising how they worry about","their health, worry about their family, their"]],[1069,["children, their house, I mean all sorts of","things."]],[1074,["But Sahaja Yogis don't, they don't."]],[1079,["We have no worry."]],[1080,["It all works out."]],[1082,["Why should we worry?"]],[1084,["That instrument of worry is over."]],[1087,["It's finished; I think it's gone out of order."]],[1091,["And what you are now in a state where you","just have no time to worry, because you are"]],[1100,["enjoying yourself."]],[1103,["This fear I have seen in people works so much","that so many diseases people get out of fear,"]],[1114,["so many diseases, specially most of these","left sided diseases people get out of fear."]],[1120,["What is there to fear?"]],[1122,["This is like you beat the Mother Earth saying","that there's a snake."]],[1128,["There's no snake, but you may just feel that","way and you may go on with this fear."]],[1133,["Anybody, any kind of a idea about a phantom","or someone or some sort of a big devil standing"]],[1144,["somewhere; it is all nonsense."]],[1148,["For you, it doesn't exist."]],[1151,["Say in the darkness you are walking so you","see forms and things and some people say I"]],[1157,["saw one on a tree, one some sort of a form;","it doesn't exist actually, it doesn't exist."]],[1164,["But this fear in man makes him think like","that."]],[1168,["He's afraid of this and afraid of that, and","then as a result, he loses his freedom."]],[1173,["He becomes slave, slave to so many people","he's afraid of - that such and such man will"]],[1181,["harm me, such and such man will trouble Me,","and the whole concept of fear has ruined our"]],[1190,["family lives."]],[1192,["For example, a wife is dominating, husband","is dominating, there's nothing to fear, nothing"]],[1200,["to fear."]],[1200,["By fear only you play into their hands."]],[1204,["So supposing the wife is dominating, just","make fun out of it."]],[1209,["If you cannot make the fun in the presence","of say your wife or your husband, better make"]],[1215,["it outside."]],[1216,["Take it, \"Oh look at that.\""]],[1218,["It is your special quality now that you can","really get rid of your fear completely."]],[1228,["What is there to be afraid of wife or afraid","of husband?"]],[1232,["What can he do to you?"]],[1234,["At the most he'll kill you, so what, you are","going to die in anyway."]],[1242,["So the fear of death is another nonsense people","have."]],[1246,["First time when I started My work everywhere","they asked Me, \"What about death?\""]],[1253,["I said, but just now you are living; why are","you asking, \"What about death?\""]],[1257,["So many people ask Me question, \"What about","our death\";"]],[1260,[" with why do you want to know about it?"]],[1262,["I'll tell you what about today, just now."]],[1266,["So this is another mad idea - that we should","know about our death, what's going to happen,"]],[1273,["and whatever happens."]],[1275,["Once you are dead you are finished."]],[1277,["You don't have to do anything after that."]],[1279,["So what's the use of knowing when, when you","will die, what will happen to you?"]],[1285,["Whatever has to happen will happen."]],[1287,["We never ask, that when I sleep what will","happen to me, do we?"]],[1290,["And this is a permanent sleep and we worry","so much about it that we should know what"]],[1296,["will happen after death."]],[1298,["One has to die at the time whenever it has","to die, because whatever is born has to be"]],[1304,["dead."]],[1307,["But you do know that you have got eternal","life."]],[1314,["You can never die."]],[1317,["Death is not this body disappearing; death","is where you are absolutely without any control"]],[1329,["of your soul live."]],[1331,["Once you are a realized soul you have all","the control, all the powers: to take your"]],[1341,["soul wherever you feel like, to be born if","you like; if you don't want you will not be"]],[1347,["born, to be born with the people in the families,","in the communities wherever you like."]],[1356,["There are many great souls I know that have","taken birth daringly into societies which"]],[1362,["are very much, I should say, deteriorating","and are in danger of getting destroyed because"]],[1370,["of stupidity they do."]],[1373,["So this happening, that we are afraid of death,","is absolutely absurd for Sahaja Yogis."]],[1388,["What is there to think even about your death?"]],[1392,["There is nothing like death for you because","you have got eternal life."]],[1399,["It's not that you continue with the same body."]],[1403,["You may go on changing your dress but you","are living, you are aware, and you know even"]],[1409,["if this body is not there-you will be there;","all the time, available for Sahaja Yoga, for"]],[1417,["anything that is to be done in the name of","reality."]],[1423,["So you must know your position as eternal","being what is your work, what is your idea,"]],[1436,["what you have to do."]],[1437,["So one has to get rid of this idea of death","because death doesn't exist for you."]],[1447,["It's finished."]],[1448,["Moreover, all such people who are afraid of","their death go on having insurances, this,"]],[1456,["that, all headaches, see, and ultimately what","happens?"]],[1462,["All these worldly things you leave here and","you depart."]],[1467,["There is I don't think anybody could carry","even a little dust with that soul"]],[1478,["which is departing."]],[1480,["But in your case, when you people are no more","on this earth so called, then you don't carry"]],[1489,["all this material things because you have","already given up."]],[1492,["You have no interest in them."]],[1494,["You're not materialistic so your spirit is","free, and when you die what happens to you"]],[1504,["is a very simple thing - that you feel very","liberated, absolutely."]],[1511,["And then you feel your freedom completely,","and you can decide what you want to do."]],[1519,["It's all under your own guidance, your own","desire; everything works out."]],[1526,["You don't feel that you have come out of your","body, and this is what should tell you that"]],[1534,["there should be no fear of death, but on the","contrary - it should be welcomed."]],[1542,["Because you will feel much more liberated,","much more at ease."]],[1550,["You don't have other problems that you have","to in any case carry on in this world so because"]],[1556,["of this body."]],[1557,["Now see I have to take some medicines, I have","to take vitamins; don't have to take anything,"]],[1563,["don't need it."]],[1565,["This body's finished is a very good idea."]],[1570,["They're so troublesome it is you see."]],[1574,["All the time despite the fact that you may","say that, \"Oh I don't care for this body,\""]],[1578,["and all that, but this body won't leave you."]],[1581,["This is the most sticky thing we have is our","body."]],[1589,["So to forget about death should be the easiest","thing for you."]],[1598,["We have broken many walls."]],[1602,["As you know very well that the conditionings","we had, we have finished that."]],[1613,["It's very surprising."]],[1614,["I've seen people when they get their realization,","immediately after that"]],[1619,["they start seeing around them."]],[1622,["They'll immediately tell you what's wrong","with their religion, then they'll tell you"]],[1628,["what's wrong with their country; what's wrong","with their culture."]],[1633,["It's through them I have come to know so much."]],[1636,["I didn't know that this was so, but they themselves","told us."]],[1640,["Now for example there's a French man, take","it - if a Frenchman gets realization, I mean"]],[1646,["you know everything about French."]],[1649,["The things you could never even imagine what","sort of people they are; they will tell you"]],[1654,["everything."]],[1655,["Same with the English I've seen."]],[1658,["English they may, they laugh at themselves","all right, but actually when they become realized"]],[1665,["souls you see, they give you a complete picture","of English people: what sort of people are"]],[1671,["there, what's wrong with them, how they are","egoistical, this, that."]],[1675,["I was amazed."]],[1676,["I mean, I, I, I never knew so many things","which I came to know through Sahaja Yogis"]],[1681,["who got realization."]],[1683,["Because they have seen all these things very","thoroughly and very closely and they knew"]],[1688,["what was it."]],[1692,["Now when you become so cleaned, washed out","completely, mind completely cleaned out from"]],[1703,["all kinds of conditionings you see; you become","like a mirror, beautiful mirror."]],[1713,["And in that mirror one can see complete picture","of the society in which you live, the complete"]],[1720,["picture of the government which rules you;","everything, so clear-cut."]],[1725,["And it is absolute."]],[1727,["It is not biased."]],[1729,["For example you ask somebody, then he will","say, \"What is your politics?\""]],[1734,["If I say My politics is I have no politics,","say, \"What you have no politics, how can we"]],[1740,["exist without politics?\""]],[1741,["I have no politics."]],[1743,["So they will go on asking questions to you","which are very much unknown."]],[1752,["But for a realized soul, it's just the other","way round."]],[1756,["Hes not only sees, but also shows and expresses,","very clearly."]],[1765,["I've been amazed at the way people have been","really so reflective of the society into which"]],[1775,["they live and the country which they represent."]],[1780,["So the identification is lost, complete identification","is lost."]],[1785,["You don't feel identified much."]],[1787,["You just see what's wrong with that world."]],[1789,["Then also another point is that you start","seeing how you can help, what you should do,"]],[1798,["how you can work it out."]],[1800,["And the importance of that becomes your main","thing in life."]],[1806,["Everybody I see, yesterday the way you brought","all this flags and all that, behind that flag,"]],[1812,["I could see, all of you wanted that peace","should prevail in those countries, they should"]],[1818,["get all the joy and beauty of Sahaja Yoga."]],[1822,["It's what a feeling it is."]],[1824,["It's not like yourself becoming Sahaja Yogis","and sitting in the corner, no."]],[1829,["They want to do it for that country about","which they are not identified, but without"]],[1838,["identification, they have that deep feeling","that they have to work out; correct it."]],[1845,["It's a very different type of personality","you develop."]],[1849,["Normally you see if you say a word against","somebody that, \"See in your country they do"]],[1855,["like this..\""]],[1856,["\"Oh what you're talking, what about your country?\""]],[1859,["Immediately."]],[1860,["They'll never accept."]],[1862,["If you just try to even say one word against","them, their country or their government, which"]],[1872,["may be the most rotten government, but no","still, \"What?"]],[1876,["We are all right.\""]],[1879,["That kind of stupid identification, which","keeps you completely glued to that society;"]],[1888,["like some people will say, \"No, no, I have","to go to the pub.\""]],[1892,["I say, why?"]],[1894,["Why you have to go to the pub?"]],[1895,["\"That's our society; that's our culture."]],[1898,["We have to go."]],[1899,["We have to go to the pub, get drunk and fall","down, all of us together."]],[1905,["That's the sort of thing we are; we can't","help it you see."]],[1909,["This is what it is.\""]],[1910,["You tell anybody that, why do you do this","like this?"]],[1914,["What is the need to do?"]],[1915,["\"Now, because I have to live in this society,","after all, after all I belong to this society"]],[1921,["and I just can't do what I like.\""]],[1926,["But when you get your realization, you can","do what you like."]],[1929,["You can do what you like, because you only","like that is righteous, that is good, that"]],[1936,["is constructive, that is helpful."]],[1938,["So you can do whatever you like; after realization,","there's no restriction for you."]],[1943,["All these restriction of, \"don't, don't, don't,","don't\" - these clearly enslave you."]],[1948,["I think it very much enslaves you."]],[1952,["But in after realization, you are such a free","bird that nothing can enslave you."]],[1958,["For example, there are many preachers who","preach - you shouldn't drink, you should not"]],[1963,["smoke, this, shouldn't take drugs, you should","do this, you should do that -"]],[1969,["but it doesn't stop."]],[1971,["It doesn't help."]],[1972,["People struggle, try everything, ultimately","they commit suicides, but they can't get rid"]],[1978,["of those habits; while now you are so powerful","that nothing can stick to you."]],[1984,["That's the purity of your character that has","come up; it doesn't allow any nonsensical"]],[1991,["things to stick to you."]],[1993,["I've heard of so many Sahaja Yogis telling","me, how their eyes have steadied down, how"]],[2000,["they have become so righteous, how they have","become so pure and they can't understand."]],[2006,["They said, \"Mother is it Your power, Your","purity You have given us, or it is our purity"]],[2012,["You have awakened?\""]],[2013,["Of course yours."]],[2014,["No doubt."]],[2015,["All these things you have, and you become","aware of it, and thus you get absolutely misidentified"]],[2024,["I should say with all these nonsensical things,","and you don't like it."]],[2030,["You just don't like it."]],[2032,["And you go on criticizing."]],[2033,["I've been to all these countries also before,","and I have met people who are very much identified,"]],[2042,["and diplomatically I was not suppose to say","anything whatsoever that would make them feel"]],[2048,["that they are doing something wrong."]],[2051,["But after Sahaja Yoga, the same people are","telling us and making fun of the whole thing."]],[2058,["For example, I've heard some Sahaja Yogis","talking to each other."]],[2060,["He says, \"You see my country, this is so stupid","thing going on.\""]],[2066,["Another one said, \"Nobody can beat mine; it's","much worse.\""]],[2071,["Is a very common competition among Sahaja","Yogis going on."]],[2083,["So that we have to see how pure we have become,","and in this purity anything that is dirty,"]],[2100,["murky, anything that will spoil this purity;","we don't like it."]],[2108,["We don't like it."]],[2111,["We are washed, cleaned, from inside, and won't","want to take anything like that"]],[2117,["within us anymore."]],[2121,["Then I've seen also, the way people have become","so compassionate."]],[2129,["Is very surprising how they have become compassionate","to each other."]],[2135,["For example, there were two Sahaja Yogis,","they were not very happy with each other,"]],[2143,["not compatible; whatever you say that is."]],[2146,["And I didn't know how to make them feel that,","\"You see the other Sahaja Yogi's all right;"]],[2152,["doesn't matter after all, what is.\""]],[2154,["\"No I don't like this thing in him.\""]],[2157,["And the another one would say, \"I don't like","this thing about him.\""]],[2161,["So it went on: \"I don't like,\" he says, \"I","don't like.\""]],[2165,["I mean they were seeing each other's defects","or whatever you may call them."]],[2172,["So I said, \"All right now will you meditate","for some time?\""]],[2176,["Again, \"Meditate, meditate.\""]],[2181,["And I said, \"Now, do you love me?\""]],[2184,["She said I, one says, \"I love You more than","he loves.\""]],[2190,["I said, \"Is difficult situation.\""]],[2195,["How to make them understand now that you cannot","weigh your love; you cannot make a"]],[2207,["chart out of it."]],[2208,["It is something within yourself, and if you","love somebody then you enjoy it."]],[2217,["I mean you cannot qualify it; you cannot quantify","it."]],[2220,["But this was going on with these two gentlemen","together, and I thought, \"Now what to do?\""]],[2229,["They are very important, and still there's","no understanding between the two."]],[2235,["So the Divine Power took over I think."]],[2240,["One of them fell very sick suddenly, very","sick."]],[2244,["And I had sent word also that, \"You'll be","sick; be careful.\""]],[2250,["But it was I mean they thought that the other","fellow might be trying to be funny or something;"]],[2259,["it was not understood."]],[2261,["He was very sick."]],[2262,["When he fell sick, then this one, the another","one, felt such tremendous love for him."]],[2272,["It's something, nobody can explain, that he","went and sat with that patient for 24 hours,"]],[2283,["and said that, \"If you need any money, I have","got.\""]],[2288,["He paid for wherever he could pay."]],[2294,["So this gentleman also was very sensible,","reasonable person on his own - felt this love,"]],[2303,["this affection, in this hard taskmaster, the","other one - and such understanding"]],[2309,[" grew up within them."]],[2312,["It is I think, is the Divine's Play that they","were brought together, so close and such compassion."]],[2322,["So the force of compassion within you is so","much, it's very subtle; you don't see."]],[2329,["Because on mental level - I was telling them,","arguing, trying to pacify him, pacify him;"]],[2338,["like that was on - it would not work out."]],[2341,["But when this force of compassion started","acting suddenly into one of them, the another"]],[2354,["one saw the compassion, the pure compassion,","and just they became great friends."]],[2366,["So one has to feel the compassion within yourself."]],[2372,["I've seen many a times that there are many","Sahaja Yogis and sometimes I have to correct"]],[2382,["them, or say something."]],[2384,["Immediately, another one will say, \"Mother","can You forgive him, You can't forgive?\""]],[2391,["I say I have forgiven."]],[2392,["I am not doing anything."]],[2395,["\"Please forgive, please.\""]],[2397,["I feel so happy to hear that, that in one","point, in one condition, when it comes to"]],[2410,["Sahaja Yogi, you support him, even against","Me; I feel happy."]],[2415,["Shows that you are not only generous, but","you are filled with your compassion."]],[2424,["So this source of compassion which is within","your being, in your heart, you have to just"]],[2434,["open your heart."]],[2435,["If you open that heart, it's like opening","the Sahasrara."]],[2440,["You'll be amazed how you can forgive people","and you can live with them."]],[2447,["I've reports which disturbs Me many a times","that people are forming different groups,"]],[2454,["and having different ashrams, and they don't","come to the collective, and all that."]],[2460,["I feel very much concerned."]],[2462,["Now what is missing is, of course, there are","also some people who think that they must"]],[2469,["have a separate, their own organization, and"]],[2472,["why should they be in the collective, and all that."]],[2474,["So that it is definite, that such a person","has not yet achieved that state of compassion."]],[2486,["In the state of compassion, you like that","somebody tells you that, \"Don't say anything"]],[2499,["to such and such person."]],[2501,["I don't want you to say this.\""]],[2504,["It's very, very joy giving to Me."]],[2507,["Like we had one couple, they were quarrelling","throughout."]],[2512,["They used to send Me letters after letters."]],[2515,["Ah baba, was fed up; telephones after telephones,","both of them quarrelling."]],[2521,["Quarrelling so much, I didn't know what to","do with them."]],[2529,["So, I thought that it's better that they divorce","and finish it off."]],[2535,["And I told them, separately, that, \"You better","divorce each other and get out of it, but"]],[2547,["the complaints you have are such that they","cannot be solved.\""]],[2552,["Said, \"How?\""]],[2553,["I said, \"You are saying that my husband doesn't","give me more time, he is always out, and he"]],[2561,["doesn't spend any nice moments with me, we","don't go out"]],[2566,[" and all these complaints are there."]],[2569,["And the husband says that, she always troubles","me that I must take her out, and I must do"]],[2574,["this, and I must do that."]],[2576,["I want to do it but I can't do it.\""]],[2577,["So I said, \"But when you take a divorce, you'll","never, can claim anything."]],[2582,["Permanently, the husband is lost and you are","lost."]],[2585,["So why do you want to do such a thing?\""]],[2587,["Immediately, know this compassion started","working, and then I put in a word, \"Supposing"]],[2596,["any one of you is sick tomorrow, then who","will look after each other?\""]],[2603,["This just put them out."]],[2605,["You know such little, little moments in life,","come in, in the life of Sahaja Yogis I've"]],[2613,["seen, that suddenly this heart opens, and","with that - they combat all these petty, nonsensical,"]],[2623,["ideas which keeps them out; out of each other","and out of the collectivity."]],[2629,["What gives me the greatest enjoyment is to","see how you love each other, care for each"]],[2636,["other, joke with each other and dance with","each other."]],[2641,["This is the greatest thing that I enjoy."]],[2644,["I don't want to get rid of this idea of Mine."]],[2648,["Despite the fact, so many times I find it's","hard to believe how could Sahaja Yogis behave"]],[2655,["like this, and try to create rifts, and distances","between the people who are realized souls."]],[2666,["Because realized souls anywhere in the world,","you should see them, they respect each other."]],[2674,["Not only respect, cared and never talked ill","of another realized soul."]],[2681,["Never."]],[2682,["I don't know if you have known about the private","lives of these saints."]],[2687,["But in India as we have had so many of them,","when you see them - how they have behaved"]],[2695,["towards each other, the way they have looked","after each other - it's so beautiful; it's"]],[2705,["so noble."]],[2706,["As if they care for the other Sahaja Yogi,","or yogi, or a realized soul, than for themselves."]],[2714,["And the whole thing makes you feel like in","a new world, of new people, who care for the"]],[2728,["feelings of others, and not - what they want","to say, or what they want to have, or they"]],[2734,["are something special."]],[2738,["Also in Sahaja Yoga, you have come; you have","lost your specialities."]],[2745,["Some of them think they're very special."]],[2750,["Supposing I call some lady to put say alta","on My Feet, she starts thinking she is very"]],[2760,["special, but I just call her because I know","she has a horrible agnya and"]],[2765,["I have to clear it out."]],[2772,["And when somebody told Me, \"Mother she thinks","something very special,\" I said, \"Really,"]],[2777,["what makes her think like that?\""]],[2778,["\"Because You call her to put some alta on","Your Feet.\""]],[2783,["I said I just called her that she has such","a horrid, ugly, agnya that she will trouble"]],[2790,["everyone, so I want to clear it."]],[2795,["So, either I should have told her that you","are a very egoistical, horrible and all the"]],[2804,["words that are possible, otherwise she won't","understand."]],[2809,["It's so surprising."]],[2811,["There is one lady who was really very nasty","to her in-laws and everybody in India, and"]],[2819,["she came to see Me."]],[2821,["I called her."]],[2822,["I actually scolded her."]],[2824,["I said, \"What business you had to behave like","this here?"]],[2828,["Your father who was such a racist, you never","said a word against him, and why are you talking"]],[2832,["so much against these people?\""]],[2834,["I scolded her."]],[2835,["She went out and told, \"Oh look at Mother","has called me; nobody is allowed to see Her.\""]],[2841,["I said, \"What's this?\""]],[2845,["It's a very funny situation with people I","sometimes feel the way they think they're"]],[2852,["something special, and they should make themselves","special."]],[2855,["It is becoming really difficult."]],[2858,["Now just to show My love, to appreciate something","people have done, and if you give some present"]],[2871,["to that person, or you show concern about","that person, because he's done some good work"]],[2879,["or something, he starts thinking he's something","special."]],[2883,["I mean is an impossible situation, because","I expect that if I have done anything good"]],[2893,["to that person, or in any way suggested My","concern about a person - that person has to"]],[2902,["become a very good Sahaja Yogi; in the sense","the most humble, and honest, and loving person."]],[2911,["Otherwise it has no meaning."]],[2915,["No use being good to anyone if that means","that person jumps into hell."]],[2922,["So this one is also another idea of speciality,","that they have lost their sense of speciality."]],[2940,["When a drop becomes the ocean, it has become","the ocean, but it's not the drop anymore."]],[2950,["If anybody thinks, \"I am a special person,\"","then know that you are no more an ocean; you"]],[2956,["are still the drop."]],[2958,["Because unless and until you are the drop,","how can you feel that \"I am something special\"?"]],[2965,["So you have lost your speciality."]],[2970,["You have lost it, because all these ideas","of speciality comes from your past."]],[2978,["One lady I met once, long time back, she was","a very rude, proud, arrogant woman."]],[2988,["So this was in Delhi, where people are very","conscious of their husband's jobs, and this"]],[2994,["and that."]],[2996,["I didn't even know the destination, or even","the designation of My husband."]],[3004,["So she was very rude to Me."]],[3008,["I said what's the matter with you, why are","you so rude, what's the problem?"]],[3013,["She said, \"You don't know?"]],[3015,["I'm the wife of such and such.\""]],[3019,["You're the wife or the husband?"]],[3023,["\"I'm the wife of such and such.\""]],[3028,["So she asked Me, \"What are you doing here?\""]],[3032,["I said, \"I am a housewife.\""]],[3038,["Then My husband came."]],[3042,["She said, \"Do you know him?\""]],[3044,["I said, \"Yes I know, why?\""]],[3049,["I thought there must be something wrong there","also."]],[3055,["So she said, \"No I just want to know."]],[3060,["How do you know him?\""]],[3064,["As if I was some criminal or what?"]],[3068,["I said, \"He's My husband.\""]],[3069,["\"Oh my God, he's your husband?\""]],[3073,["What happened?"]],[3074,["As if ten serpents had bitten her."]],[3080,["Maybe, maybe her husband was at a much lower","position than my husband, maybe something"]],[3088,["which I am not conscious of it."]],[3090,["But this is what is \"I'm something special.\""]],[3099,["This stupid idea of being special has to be","completely negated in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3107,["Not mentally."]],[3108,["Not mentally."]],[3110,["Mentally if you're again saying, \"I'm not","special, I'm not special,\" like a mantra,"]],[3121,["you'll become much more."]],[3126,["Because you'll say, \"I've said this mantra","23,000 times."]],[3133,["Who can say like me?\""]],[3141,["So this idea - I'm something special, I'm","something great, I'm something out of the"]],[3148,["blue, something superior to others - just","vanishes."]],[3156,["Like as I said, you are a drop in the sea."]],[3162,["You have become the ocean, but you are no","more a drop, to have any relative value system."]],[3171,["There's no relative value system."]],[3173,["There is no system by which you can say that","I'm higher or he's lower; all that has created"]],[3181,["all the problems of the world."]],[3184,["See from our caste system in India, the social","systems in the West, the racialism in the"]],[3192,["West, also self consciousness of \"my religion","is better, yours is worst, we are the best\""]],[3203,["- all these things have created problems."]],[3206,["It has done no good."]],[3209,["It has failed and failed and failed."]],[3212,["So in Sahaja Yoga at least don't bring this","disease anymore - that, \"I'm better, we, our"]],[3219,["country's better...\""]],[3222,["This speciality you should drop, and real","beauty of your personality will show."]],[3231,["For that you don't need a special scale, you","don't need a special body, you don't need"]],[3238,["a special, what you can call, a glamorous","look."]],[3243,["What you need is a beautiful heart."]],[3246,["And I tell you, it's the beautiful heart that","attracts; nothing else."]],[3253,["It's the beautiful heart that you want to","have."]],[3256,["I've known people nay many like that."]],[3262,["There was one gentleman who divorced his first","wife."]],[3266,["She maybe not be so good looking, maybe ugly,","or whatever it was."]],[3270,["Then he married another good-looking woman,","and he ran away from the house."]],[3278,["So I asked him why."]],[3279,["You didn't like that woman because she was","ugly or whatever it was, so why have you now"]],[3285,["running away from this one?"]],[3286,["\"She has no heart."]],[3290,["She has no heart.\""]],[3294,["And this is what you have - a very great,","generous, beautiful, dharmic heart."]],[3303,["You have got it as a present from the Divine,","and which you must respect."]],[3313,["Should be proud of it, and enjoy it, as you","should enjoy your generosity."]],[3324,["You should enjoy the way all this nature is","enjoying itself."]],[3331,["To be very meticulous about things, to be","all the time correcting others, is a headache."]],[3338,["It's a headache."]],[3341,["The best thing is to correct yourself, and","laugh at yourself; that's the best way you"]],[3346,["can do it."]],[3348,["Everybody has some funny things about themselves."]],[3352,["I also have; I must confess."]],[3356,["And I enjoy them because I think I try and","try, but always I forget."]],[3362,["For example spectacles, I always forget them."]],[3365,["Before coming see I must always forget it."]],[3369,["I tell Myself that I need it, I should take","it, must remember; but invariably I forget,"]],[3376,["and I don't know why."]],[3379,["I, I, I can't do without it, but still I forget."]],[3384,["There's so many things."]],[3385,["For example, I don't know how to count money."]],[3389,["If you may give me 100 rupees, I'll count","it 200 rupees."]],[3393,["I tell you I, I'm good at mathematics, but","I can't count."]],[3398,["I don't know how to sign a check; can you","believe it?"]],[3400,["I can't sign."]],[3401,["You have to write the check for Me, otherwise","I can't."]],[3405,["And somebody asks Me say for say 100 rupees;","I'll give him a big 500 and forget about it."]],[3414,["And that person says, \"Mother You gave me","500.\""]],[3416,["No, no, no, I gave you 100 only."]],[3418,["\"No, You gave me 500.\""]],[3420,["I went home and found out."]],[3421,["It's all right."]],[3422,["After all, if he's dishonest - he's dishonest;","if he's honest - he's honest."]],[3427,["So why to worry about how much money you gave,","and this thing, that thing, meticulously you"]],[3433,["see, finding everything like this?"]],[3436,["And I've seen with all these meticulous people,","they always fail."]],[3440,["Because you see this brain plays some tricks","on them."]],[3444,["For example, there was one fellow who told","Me that,"]],[3447,[" \"The size of your car is such and such.\""]],[3450,["All right then."]],[3452,["\"So the size of the garage will be such and","such.\""]],[3455,["I said all right."]],[3457,["So, when we build the garage, the car won't","get in."]],[3466,["I said such a meticulous architect, and such","a well-known person who has got so many awards,"]],[3474,["this, that - how could he make such a mistake?"]],[3478,["But I still didn't understand it you see."]],[3480,["Now he said, \"Now you better buy a smaller","car.\""]],[3488,["I said at least now you measure this garage","in a proper way, otherwise again if I buy"]],[3494,["something it won't enter in."]],[3497,["So you see what I'm saying, we are so particular,","so meticulous."]],[3502,["Now see these little, little flowers I see","them here; they're not meticulous."]],[3507,["They are growing on their own freely, everybody","gets the sun's rays, and they're quite happy."]],[3513,["But the way we are particular, those people","are very particular, are headaches to themselves."]],[3520,["And then ultimately they find that it's not","so."]],[3523,["You have lost that; you have lost that meticulousness."]],[3526,["I know of a Sahaj Yogini; she was running","a shop, and she said, \"Mother I knew each"]],[3532,["and everything, and I knew each and every","price, and everything I knew in this shop,"]],[3537,["but since I've got realization; I've forgotten","everything.\""]],[3541,["So are you happy or unhappy?"]],[3544,["\"I'm very happy.\""]],[3545,["Why?"]],[3546,["\"Because now I'm making a big profit.\""]],[3549,["Profit is the main thing."]],[3551,["Why should you try to remember each and every","thing?"]],[3554,["So it is to be very meticulous, to be very","systematic, very, world is, if you see around"]],[3563,["- no tree is systematic."]],[3564,["It is unsystematically systematic."]],[3568,["Some leaves are this side, some are that side;","some branches are on that side."]],[3574,["There's no system, because then you become","a military, if you form a system."]],[3581,["So in Sahaja Yoga there is no system."]],[3584,["We are beyond time."]],[3586,["We are beyond all kinds of systems; we have","no system."]],[3591,["All of our system is, \"What is the unigion","within ourselves?\""]],[3597,["Like these two hands, they have no system","built in nothing, but they move."]],[3603,["Especially Italy if you want, both the hands","move like that all the time in Italy."]],[3610,["And I don't know what it means, but they all","do the same thing."]],[3615,["There's no system built in."]],[3617,["Nobody said them that do these gestures and","all that."]],[3620,["But they do it, and do it naturally, all of","them together - without any system."]],[3627,["So to build up mental systems is wrong and","against Sahaja Yoga."]],[3634,["Some people have written to Me, \"Mother we","want to translate your transcriptions, do"]],[3639,["this, do that\" and plans."]],[3640,["I said forget it."]],[3642,["Forget."]],[3645,["Because if you start planning you see, you","will definitely, definitely fall into the"]],[3651,["trap of systems."]],[3654,["You'll have to follow systems; this system","is good, that system is good."]],[3658,["Why not have this way?"]],[3660,["And because I don't, I don't say that it's","wrong, because you have been used to systems."]],[3666,["Especially in the West people have over systematic,","over systematic, in everything."]],[3674,["Like they'll have courses you see built up,","then the spoons, then the forks, then the"]],[3681,["how to move, and what to eat, and how to eat."]],[3686,["I mean it is too much."]],[3689,["If you have to eat food, it's straightforward;","you can eat it with your hands."]],[3695,["No system needed."]],[3696,["For all these systems and norms are too much","in the West, and you should really try to"]],[3703,["them curb down."]],[3705,["As a result they had anti-culture and all","that nonsense; another kind of stupidity where"]],[3712,["they were building up another kind of a system."]],[3716,["See then they said, \"We are hippies now.\""]],[3718,["All right."]],[3719,["So they must have hair never washed, never","clean with lice in their heads, and must be"]],[3726,["all like, you can say, the shankara style","you see."]],[3733,["So all of them have to have that."]],[3735,["Again system."]],[3738,["There's no variety; one hippie means another","the same."]],[3741,["You cannot make them out one from another."]],[3744,["If somebody puts say a ring here - everybody","will put."]],[3747,["If he puts a ring here - everybody will put;","without any brains, without any understanding."]],[3754,["And they talk of individuality; of personality","-where is the individuality?"]],[3760,["There's no individuality, because you take","to anything that your gang, you can call,"]],[3768,["or you can call the crowds that take it, very","fashionable."]],[3775,["In India if you say if it is very fashionable,","it means it is very expensive, and very beautiful"]],[3784,["and is, I mean is very elite, elite word."]],[3791,["But when I said, \"This is very fashionable,\"","means everybody likes it."]],[3795,["It could be punky thing or anything, it's","fashionable."]],[3799,["Finished."]],[3801,["It's the fashion."]],[3802,["Means you do not have your own idea, your","own personality, your own individuality."]],[3810,["In Sahaja Yoga, you too are not bound to any","fashion, no fashion."]],[3818,["If like; wear this, wear that, whatever you","like."]],[3822,["If you fit do what you like, you can wear","whatever you like, but you, as I said again"]],[3829,["that you will govern yourself, you'll be your","own guru, you'll be your own master, and you'll"]],[3834,["do whatever is good, whatever is decent, whatever","the Deities will like, will just do it that"]],[3843,["way because now you are a Sahaja Yogi."]],[3847,["So the life becomes so much easier, so much","easier."]],[3851,["You don't worry about things which are not","there, and you are not also worried about"]],[3857,["the things which are there."]],[3859,["Because you think now, you see something,","all right I have got these knives now; I must"]],[3866,["keep this one for somebody."]],[3869,["I must give it to someone."]],[3871,["So I got a ring which was quite big."]],[3874,["Was thinking whom should I give this; who","has got thick fingers?"]],[3878,["So I started looking at the fingers of everyone","you see, whosoever has a thick finger I'll"]],[3884,["give him this one."]],[3885,["I mean the thought was just the other way","around."]],[3888,["Supposing you are not a Sahaja Yogi then you'll","say, \"Oh Ma, such a big thick finger, why"]],[3893,["not take out some gold and use it, sell it","off?\""]],[3896,["Or else you see, \"You can take out the stone","from here.\""]],[3903,["I mean all kinds of nonsensical things you'll","think, but you'll not think that you better"]],[3908,["give it to somebody because you can't wear","it; it's too big for you."]],[3911,["Why not give it to other?"]],[3913,["What's wrong?"]],[3915,["After all, it is not fitting you, so give","it to other."]],[3919,["But this is only possible in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3922,["I've seen people, very kind, very, very kind","people who have been very sweet to each other"]],[3933,["and exactly what the other person wants, they'll","buy and give it to that person."]],[3940,["Or may say, oh no I have one, I'll give it","to you."]],[3944,["They do it like that."]],[3947,["It's all the time thinking about others."]],[3950,["What should I give?"]],[3952,["What should I do?"]],[3955,["It's the expression of that joy, the compassion","within you."]],[3959,["You use your matter for that, all the time,","all the time."]],[3965,["Like somebody's house was burgled in Canada."]],[3971,["So she writes to Me, \"Thank God my house is","cleaned out now, I didn't know what to do"]],[3975,["with it - the junk\"."]],[3977,["So you see this kind of an attitude comes","in that if you have to do, give to someone,"]],[3983,["then give it to someone who is a Sahaja Yogi","to express your love."]],[3990,["But normally people will do whatever is the","junk in the house, you see whatever is rotten,"]],[3996,["finished, that they will give as a present."]],[3998,["But when you are a Sahaja Yogi you want to","give something really very special, because"]],[4004,["the whole being has become so beautiful - just","like a flower I should say which wants to"]],[4013,["give fragrance to others; all the time the","fragrance of your compassion and love, affection"]],[4018,["and security."]],[4022,["It's a new age, that what they say, but I","would say it's a new human beings that are"]],[4032,["before Me."]],[4033,["And all this newness has so many beautiful","facets that they really sparkle like diamonds,"]],[4042,["no doubt about it."]],[4046,["My only blessings to you is that you grow","in it and grow in it and become greater and"]],[4059,["greater people; never thinking that you are","better than others; never thinking that you"]],[4065,["are special than others."]],[4067,["This will definitely soothe you down completely."]],[4071,["Somebody might have hurt you somewhere, doesn't","matter."]],[4074,["Somebody must have scolded you, doesn't matter."]],[4077,["What is your capacity is to - love another","person, and to be affectionate and kind."]],[4085,["I'm really amazed how these 25 years have","passed with all kinds of stupid problems,"]],[4095,["and nice things and - such a mixture."]],[4098,["And all those things have never disturbed","Me; I was never disturbed."]],[4105,["I used to act sometimes that I am angry, or","sometimes I used to say things which I should"]],[4111,["not have normally said, because it was needed","to be said."]],[4116,["But, on the whole, like sitting in a very","big ship you can say, we all are elevated"]],[4129,["into the realm of Divine Love."]],[4133,["And this is what one has to enjoy."]],[4136,["One person if he has that love and compassion,","and that pure love, then that person can emit"]],[4145,["it to others, and the record of this compassion","is extremely beautiful; which cannot be described"]],[4155,["in words."]],[4156,["Like yesterday I couldn't speak."]],[4158,["In what words I could put My feelings?"]],[4162,["I thought there are no words yet created on","this earth to express My deep feeling that"]],[4172,["how you people have taken Sahaja Yoga so well","and have understood it."]],[4180,["May God bless you all."]],[4199,["Sahasrara Puja is a short one."]],[4203,["We don't have a very long puja for Sahasrara,","because you know Sahasrara breaks in no time."]],[4213,["So it's not a very long puja, but it's very","deep, and again ultimately the last chakra"]],[4222,["which is opened out is here, is the heart."]],[4226,["So in the Sahasrara Puja our hearts open out,","that's the main thing, and that is what one"]],[4234,["has to enjoy, opening of your heart."]],[4238,["Don't worry about any Deities, about any rituals,","any this and that, but just open your heart."]],[4247,["We are not bound by anything; just open your","heart."]]]);
